        <Element Type="Comment" Id="7C67B8B6">
            <Comment>
                Objective of this trigger is to use the location of the caster and the location of the target to 
                interpolate the real target point of the Unleash Banshee ability.  It should be in a straight line 
                from the caster, through the target, all the way out to the edge of the map.  So we find out 
                length of the hypotenuse of triangle 1 and triangle 2 in the figure below, and fire the arrow to
                the shorter of the two triangle lengths.
            </Comment>
        </Element>
        <Element Type="Comment" Id="B7B16E0B">
            <Comment>
                                                                 /|
                 _______________________/  |__
                |                                    |       /     |    |
                |                                    |  1 /  2   |    |
                |                                    |  /_____|    |
                |                                    T                 |
                |                                   /                   |
                |                                 /                     |
                |                               C                      |
                | ___________________________ |
            </Comment>
        </Element>
